          "short": "Construction with $AB=7\\text{ cm}$, $AC=4\\text{ cm}$ and $\\angle BAC=110^{\\circ}$.",
          "worked": "Draw $AB=7\\text{ cm}$. At $A$, use a protractor to draw a ray making $110^{\\circ}$ with $AB$. Mark $C$ on this ray so that $AC=4\\text{ cm}$. The construction is completed by joining $B$ to $C$ in part b.",
